OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee told he needs more proof
OL,4,Afor blue badge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor amputee Nigel Ward, the evidence is
OL,7,Fundeniable.
OL,9,FThe 71-year-old from King's Lynn
OL,10,Fassumed that providing photos showing
OL,11,Fhis missing leg would be enough proof
OL,12,Fto get his Blue Badge renewed by
OL,13,FNorfolk County Council.
OL,15,FBut Ward has been asked to verify his
OL,16,Fdisability further, with one council
OL,17,Fworker suggesting amputees can run
OL,18,Fmarathons - a level of physical
OL,19,Fendurance he insists he does not have.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
